window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-090-6173d4b974abcffc.json"]={sha256:"6173d4b974abcffc5f0d297cf8dc09c52f99b5135d9915f53934ef31e0d8a5e3",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-7b3e45cb45d047ea","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/antipatterns/noisy-neighbor/noisy-neighbor","title":"Azure Architecture Center: noisy neighbor antipattern","titleEn":"Azure Architecture Center: noisy neighbor antipattern","publisher":"Microsoft","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-090","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-090","related":[{"id":"security-v27-091","referenceUrls":["https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/"],"title":"Google SRE：多視窗error-budget burn與恢復後告警解除","titleEn":"Google SRE: multiwindow error-budget burn and alert reset after recovery","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付tenant-backlog.csv、batch-allocations.csv、fairness-report.json與isolation-boundaries.md；說明未測真實雲端性能或資料授權。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver tenant-backlog.csv, batch-allocations.csv, fairness-report.json and isolation-boundaries.md. State that real cloud performance and data-access authorization were not tested by this scheduling fixture.","difference":"從相同請求定義計算長短視窗錯誤比例與burn rate，明確實作兩視窗同時超標的教學條件，保留無流量為未知。","differenceEn":"Calculate error ratios and burn rates from consistent request definitions in long and short windows. Implement the explicit teaching condition that both windows exceed threshold, keeping zero-traffic windows unknown.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Azure noisy-neighbor文件討論共享資源競爭與隔離；本課的固定預留政策是教學設計，資源公平與租戶資料授權仍為不同問題。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 每批10槽、各工作同時長；A有20、B有4、C有4。無保障先取A十件；預留政策分A4、B3、C3，未使用槽才可借出。 兩方案第一批都完成10件，但B+C完成率無保障0/8=0%，預留為6/8=75%；總吞吐相同不代表租戶體驗相同。","SRE以相對SLO允許錯誤比例的速率描述burn；多視窗可檢查錯誤是否持續。下面固定流量假設只用於把一小時消耗映射到30日預算。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 SLO99.9%，允許比例0.001；長窗1小時錯誤0.01，短窗5分鐘錯誤0.002；教學門檻兩窗burn都大於6，期間720小時。 長窗burn=0.01/0.001=10，短窗2未過6；固定流量下一小時消耗10/720=1.388889%的總預算。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Azure noisy-neighbor guidance discusses contention and isolation in shared resources. The fixed-reservation policy here is a teaching design; resource fairness remains distinct from tenant data-access authorization. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Each batch has ten slots and equal-duration jobs. Backlogs are A twenty, B four and C four. An unreserved A-first batch takes ten A jobs; the reserved policy allocates A four, B three and C three. Both policies finish ten jobs in the first batch. B+C completion is 0/8=0% without reservation and 6/8=75% with reservation; equal aggregate throughput does not imply equal tenant experience.","SRE burn rate compares observed error fraction with the fraction permitted by the SLO. Multiple windows check whether errors continue; constant traffic is assumed only when mapping one hour of consumption to a thirty-day budget. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The SLO is 99.9%, allowing an error fraction of 0.001. The one-hour ratio is 0.01 and five-minute ratio 0.002; the teaching threshold requires both burn rates above six over a 720-hour period. Long-window burn is 0.01/0.001=10, while short-window burn is two and fails the threshold. Under constant traffic, that hour consumes 10/720=1.388889% of the total budget.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-100","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/34/r1/upd1/final"],"title":"NIST SP 800-34：跨資料集一致復原切點與服務驗收","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-34: consistent recovery cuts across datasets and service acceptance","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付tenant-backlog.csv、batch-allocations.csv、fairness-report.json與isolation-boundaries.md；說明未測真實雲端性能或資料授權。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver tenant-backlog.csv, batch-allocations.csv, fairness-report.json and isolation-boundaries.md. State that real cloud performance and data-access authorization were not tested by this scheduling fixture.","difference":"依合成共同提交批次ID尋找兩資料集都可驗證的最新切點，檢查訂單與庫存不變量；再以服務驗收時線確認可用。","differenceEn":"Find the newest verifiable common commit-batch identifier across two synthetic datasets, check order/inventory invariants, and then confirm usable service through a separate restoration-acceptance timeline.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["Azure noisy-neighbor文件討論共享資源競爭與隔離；本課的固定預留政策是教學設計，資源公平與租戶資料授權仍為不同問題。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 每批10槽、各工作同時長；A有20、B有4、C有4。無保障先取A十件；預留政策分A4、B3、C3，未使用槽才可借出。 兩方案第一批都完成10件，但B+C完成率無保障0/8=0%，預留為6/8=75%；總吞吐相同不代表租戶體驗相同。","NIST SP 800-34提供應變復原與驗證規劃；此課共同批次模型是原創簡化設計，並不宣稱任意兩份同時間快照自然具交易一致性。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 事故發生100分鐘；訂單可驗證批次時間70、80、95，庫存70、80、90；同一批次ID在兩邊均通過不變量才可用。 共同批次70、80，最新一致切點80，距事故20分鐘；各自最新95與90不能組成同一共同批次。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Azure noisy-neighbor guidance discusses contention and isolation in shared resources. The fixed-reservation policy here is a teaching design; resource fairness remains distinct from tenant data-access authorization. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Each batch has ten slots and equal-duration jobs. Backlogs are A twenty, B four and C four. An unreserved A-first batch takes ten A jobs; the reserved policy allocates A four, B three and C three. Both policies finish ten jobs in the first batch. B+C completion is 0/8=0% without reservation and 6/8=75% with reservation; equal aggregate throughput does not imply equal tenant experience.","NIST SP 800-34 supports contingency recovery and validation planning. The shared-batch model is an original simplification; it does not claim that arbitrary snapshots with matching timestamps are transactionally consistent. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The incident occurs at minute 100. Orders has verified batches at 70,80,95; inventory at 70,80,90. A batch is eligible only if the same commit identity passes invariants in both datasets. Common batches are 70 and 80, so the latest consistent cut is 80, twenty minutes before the incident. Independently choosing 95 and 90 does not produce a common committed batch.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-01fa52816728d6be","url":"https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/","title":"Google SRE Workbook: alerting on SLOs","titleEn":"Google SRE Workbook: alerting on SLOs","publisher":"Google","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-f561a6295e1b6a09","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/34/r1/upd1/final","title":"NIST SP 800-34 Revision 1 contingency planning","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-34 Revision 1 contingency planning","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
